            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:41:20 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1914</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.19.14</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.19.14</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Rocket.Chat support. Connect it in Settings → Rocket.Chat with a
      personal access token or your password, choose the rooms Jarvis may
      read, and the asks in your DMs, mentions and threads show up in Focus.
      Messages are read live and never stored.</li>
  <li>Jarvis now finds tasks for you with any chat app connected, not only
      Slack, so Microsoft Teams and Rocket.Chat users get tasks too.</li>
  <li>If Rocket.Chat stops accepting Jarvis's sign-in, Focus tells you and
      links straight to reconnecting.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
